:INFO
Art. 2a Agreements on data protection
If the applicable agreement allows the sending authority to set out data protection provisions that are to be respected by the receiving authority, the Federal Council may enter into agreements on data protection. The data protection provisions to be respected must provide at least the same level of protection as the Data Protection Act of 25 September 2020 (FADP) and this Act.
|

:NOTE
